    "title": "The Man Behind the Music : DJ Sasha - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Brina Sastyangkul ,\n16 days ago One of our very own Ram seniors has created a name for himself with a humble beginning in his very own backyard. PEACE senior Sasha Mejia, or more formally known by many as DJ Sasha, has shown out with his DJ-ing skills at many school events such as the Dance Invitational, the homecoming carnival, football games, rallies, and more. His first hurrah, however, was DJing with his uncle at his own 4th of July party four years ago. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
